Subject: [PATCH] Add Firefox build and site-list export/import

- build.mjs: build dist/chrome and dist/firefox from one codebase; the
  Firefox manifest is derived from manifest.json (event page instead of
  service worker, gecko id, min version).
- options: add Export/Import of the site list (domain + daily limit) as
  JSON, so lists can move between Chrome and Firefox.
- .gitignore: ignore dist/, node_modules/, web-ext-artifacts/.

